Subject: [PATCH 57/57] Ctrl+Alt+1/2/3 switch a Markdown tab to Source, Split
 or Preview

The keys follow the order of the header buttons and go through the same
SetView message, so focus behaves as on a click. Other tabs ignore them.
The View menu lists the keys next to the views, and the header buttons'
tooltips name them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

